 "description": "Every repo in the org, whether or not it has ever released \u2014 a repo with no releases still gets a row, ranked maximally stale, rather than being silently absent. See the glossary below for what 'staleness_ratio' and 'pace' mean.",
 "source": "release_repo_summary.csv",
